WEBVTT

00:26:29.667 --> 00:26:31.768
AG: When I came back 20 minutes later,

00:26:31.792 --> 00:26:34.184
Anthony had something ready for me.

00:26:34.208 --> 00:26:36.226
Anthony: It's a puffy little taco, yes.

00:26:36.250 --> 00:26:37.893
It has frosting, caramel frosting,

00:26:37.917 --> 00:26:39.851
and then regular caramel on top as well.

00:26:39.875 --> 00:26:44.559
AG: It looks like a taco
that had a chance to rise in an oven

00:26:44.583 --> 00:26:46.643
and had a bunch of bread in it.

00:26:46.667 --> 00:26:49.393
I love the touch of the way
the frosting is sprinkled

00:26:49.417 --> 00:26:52.393
and it almost, the little pieces
of Cinnabon bread

00:26:52.417 --> 00:26:53.934
almost look like taco meat.

00:26:53.958 --> 00:26:55.583
Alright, how do I eat this?

00:26:56.917 --> 00:26:58.434
Like a taco, OK.

00:26:58.458 --> 00:26:59.750
Oh my God.